WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.606
Nineteen design-system pages are now components in one library, built once and used

00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:08.649
everywhere.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.669
Earlier screens drew their own versions. Now a screen takes the component by its

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:16.078
design-system name.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.739
Buttons in every variant and size. A busy button ignores a second press.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.092
One form field gives every control its label, hint and error, tied together for

00:00:31.092 --> 00:00:34.486
screen readers. Sign in and Join already use it.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.157
Checkboxes, radios, switches and toggles carry their state as attributes, never

00:00:41.157 --> 00:00:42.306
colour alone.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.853
Chips, badges, counts and avatars. A photo that fails shows initials.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.251
A spinner waits before it shows. A tooltip hides on Escape. A skip link jumps to the

00:00:57.251 --> 00:00:58.051
content.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.549
Every behaviour has a test that failed first, and the first load did not grow.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.600
Next, feedback and overlays, then layout.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.014
That's slice one point four. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:19.014 --> 00:01:20.280
body and spirit.
